WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.466 --> 00:00:03.716
- Remmy, come on, let's go.

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:05.850
- [Narrator] It's a new
week at Doggie Do Good,

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.733
and the puppies are back on campus.

00:00:08.053 --> 00:00:10.636
(upbeat music)

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.423
A week is an eternity
in the life of a puppy,

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.700
and if any dogs haven't been working hard

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.503
on their studies, it'll show.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:23.083
Only the best pups will one
day graduate Puppy Prep.

00:00:24.493 --> 00:00:27.076
(upbeat music)

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.000
Last week, the trainers noticed

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.930
eight month old Kaya preferred the company

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.563
of people to other dogs.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.810
This week, it's beginning to
look like more of the same.

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.413
After a brief hello to
the people, however,

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:14.430
she begins to play with the other pups;

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:16.693
a good sign for her socialization.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.793
The biggest change this
week is with the oldest pup;

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.273
the dog formerly known as Deacon.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.373
Like many of the dogs here,

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.570
Deacon already has a family waiting

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:33.920
for him to finish training.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:36.973
Graduation is never assured,

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:39.560
but if he passes he'll
be going to his forever

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.623
family in only two weeks.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.640
Over the weekend, that family informed

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:46.060
Doggie Do Good that they want to

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:49.913
name their dog (sighing) Demian.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:53.853
This isn't unusual.

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.290
Dogs sometimes go through several names

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:58.090
before getting their permanent name,

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:01.010
and for the pups it's actually
not that big of a deal.

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.770
The trainers begin transitioning a dog

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:05.873
to a new name by using both.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.120
For instance, when they want the newly

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.588
christened Demian to
come, trainers will say:

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:13.260
- [Karyn] Deacon, Demian,
Deacon, Demian, come.

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:14.610
- [Narrator] And when the dog reacts,

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:16.803
they praise the dog using its new name.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:21.453
After as little as a few days,

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.510
the trainers can begin
to drop the old name,

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:24.867
and just call for Demian.

00:02:25.792 --> 00:02:28.209
- Good boy, good come Demian.

00:02:28.866 --> 00:02:30.116
Demian release.

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.280
- [Narrator] After some morning exercise,

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.930
the dogs leave the paddock
for some down-stay drills.

00:02:37.748 --> 00:02:40.248
(light music)

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.203
German shepard Tank seems distracted.

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:46.453
It appears Karyn has a treat.

00:02:47.070 --> 00:02:48.880
While Kaya and Luke are only mildly

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.130
interested in the feline,

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:52.603
Tank can barely contain himself.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.463
This isn't new.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.930
During the coming months Tank will need

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:59.180
to work on better
suppressing his prey drive.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.630
His future family needs to count on him

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:04.080
staying focused when he
encounters other animals.

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:07.573
The moment that trainer
Nece is distracted,

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.023
Tank makes a move,

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.173
but he never had a chance.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:16.003
Karyn releases the cat, but Tank is shook.

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.423
It'll be a while before
he can regain focus,

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.013
losing valuable class time.

00:03:22.819 --> 00:03:25.152
(cat meows)

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.180
Meanwhile, most of the younger
dogs appear to be doing well.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:33.150
A frisbee may be tempting, but
these pups know it's a trick.

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:36.070
As for Remmy, after her tough day

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.293
at the beach last week,

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:40.123
Remmy needs to be on
her best behavior today.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:44.493
It's not looking good.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.010
Trainer Karyn fetches the
eight month old golden

00:03:49.010 --> 00:03:50.660
and puts her back into down-stay.

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:56.510
Remmy should be growing out
of this behavior by now.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.103
If she continues to break like this

00:03:58.103 --> 00:03:59.633
over the next few months,

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.220
the trainers will have some difficult

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.470
conversations about her
continued enrollment.

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:11.243
If Remmy's in search of a roll model,

00:04:11.243 --> 00:04:13.023
Demian's her guy.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:16.110
He, too, used to have
problems staying still,

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.573
but now, even when he's not laying down,

00:04:19.170 --> 00:04:20.623
he holds his ground.

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:23.663
Even when Paul claps for him,

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.513
until he hears the word release,

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.253
Demian knows to stay.

00:04:28.637 --> 00:04:30.720
- [Paul] Demian, release.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.700
- [Narrator] Demian knows he did well.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.420
He has a family waiting for him,

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.950
and they're counting on this training

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:37.503
to help them for years to come.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.080
One woman who's thankful
for that training is Kallie.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.413
Kallie is blind on her right side,

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.320
and after being struck by
a car she never saw coming,

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.870
she knew getting a service
dog could save her life.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:54.010
Doggie Do Good took Kallie's needs

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.130
and trained Belgian Malinois Canaan

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.603
to meet them perfectly.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:00.540
Maybe you didn't notice, but all the pups

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.390
in training learned to heel
on the left side of a person.

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:05.900
Canaan, however, was specially trained

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.550
since a pup to walk on the right.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.320
This way, he can move in front of Kallie

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.970
if something is about to hit her.

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:15.560
At 10 years old, Canaan is around

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:17.793
the age of retirement
for most service dogs.

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:20.870
When it's time for Canaan
to hang up the harness,

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.520
he'll live out the remainder of his days

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.283
loved by Callie and her
family as a non-working pet.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:33.163
To get dogs like Canaan
comfortable around traffic,

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.150
the puppies need to take field
trips like the one today;

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:37.983
to the bus station.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.950
Not all field trips can be to the beach.

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:46.450
No matter what, a new location means

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.643
another local flavor of grass to sample,

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:51.193
and also new challenges.

00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:54.373
They may seem boring to us,

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.270
but buses are a common reason puppies

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.883
flunk out of service dog school.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:00.073
The loud noises,

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.000
(bus hisses)

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.163
cramped spaces,

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:07.603
and sudden movements are all
huge challenges for a puppy.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.303
If a dog can't become
comfortable around a bus,

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.950
there aren't many options left

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.963
for a puppy other than expulsion.

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:18.000
While they wait to work
with the trainers around

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.853
the buses, the pups hold
tight near some benches.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.760
If a puppy were to break
from their down-stay

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.573
and run into traffic, it could be fatal.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:28.910
Because of this risk, all of the dogs

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.363
are tied up during down-stay.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:33.550
Even someone as far along in
their schooling as Deacon.

00:06:33.786 --> 00:06:35.517
Demian. I meant Demian.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:43.253
One of the first to take a
lap around the buses is Luke.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.603
As the bus makes noises, Luke
is curious but not frightened.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.570
This is a great reaction
from the eight month golden.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.933
However, being calm around
the buses is only step one.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:57.170
Luke still needs to be able to work.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.850
Even though it's loud,
he keeps checking in

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.840
with the trainer to make
sure he's not missing

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:04.390
any commands he otherwise
wouldn't be able to hear.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:07.073
One such command is alert.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:10.113
Alert is triggered by an
alarm on the trainer's watch.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:12.220
And while it's difficult
to make out with all

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.763
the commotion, Luke is
focused enough to hear it.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.930
Another of Luke's special
abilities is pressure therapy.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:24.083
Pressure can help calm those
with anxiety or PTSD attacks.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.483
Since an episode can happen anywhere,

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.620
even at a bus station, Luke needs to

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:30.520
always be ready to spring into action.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.143
Great work, Luke.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:38.743
Meanwhile, back with
the dogs in down-stay,

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.373
trainer Paul works with
Kaya on her new skill.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:42.653
Steady.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.640
It's only been a week since she was

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.550
introduced to the command at the beach,

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:48.903
but she is learning fast.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.334
The dog with the most experience
with steady is Demian.

00:07:53.334 --> 00:07:54.667
- [Paul] Steady.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.250
- [Narrator] Today, however, he's

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.113
practicing his get-it command.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.983
And Karyn is not making it easy.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:07.763
A slick flashlight.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:11.193
A measuring cup.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:16.933
Even an oversized mug.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:22.193
All pose challenges but
Demian is persistent.

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.440
His ability to perform
his most complex actions

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.630
with all the distractions
of the bus station

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.180
means he's still on track
to graduate in two weeks.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.023
Keep it up, Demian.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.773
It's Benelli's turn by the buses.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.653
At only six months old,

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.560
Benelli is the youngest of the puppies,

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.410
and the most likely to be frightened.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:48.053
To comfort her, Paul has
brought her favorite toy.

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:53.043
At first, she's able to
retrieve it with no problem.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:56.140
But when the loud bus starts up,

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.300
there's a noticeable change in the pup.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.460
Benelli doesn't finish the retrieval

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:02.853
and begins to move away.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.950
It doesn't take long,
though, for the puppy

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.890
to become used to the sound of the engine,

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.440
so she gets back to her drills.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.645
Suddenly, a new noise.

00:09:12.645 --> 00:09:13.940
(bus hisses)

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.200
Benelli drops her toy,
gets low to the ground,

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.703
and begins to retreat hard.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:20.313
Her only focus is getting
away from the bus.

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.950
Paul recognizes she's
scared and immediately

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:26.900
tries to encourage the chocolate
lab with her favorite toy.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.973
But Benelli doesn't respond.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.620
Paul gets down to Benelli's
level and begins to pet her.

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:42.923
Even still, her only focus
is getting away from the bus.

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:47.070
This is a puppy completely shut down.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:49.573
Her tail is tucked and
she's lost all focus.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.180
Paul tries to bring her back online by

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.173
rewarding her for simple down commands,

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.160
but she continues to ignore her toy.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:59.423
A new toy gets Benelli's
tail wagging again,

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.033
but she's still distressed.

00:10:03.477 --> 00:10:05.733
As Benelli tries to crawl under Paul,

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.710
it becomes clear the only way to get

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.930
Benelli feeling better
will be to remove her

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.383
from any sight of the bus.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:16.620
Finally away from the noises of the buses,

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:18.790
Benelli is soon back to her playful self.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.910
When it's time for her
to go back to down-stay,

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.423
she's exhausted.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:26.960
Hopefully this was just a
temporary setback for the lab.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.210
If she can't learn to
face her fear of buses,

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:31.723
there's no way she'll
pass service dog school.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:39.513
Mr. Pip, it's your turn.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:42.040
The undeniable Mr. Pip has had issues

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:43.543
with loud noises in the past.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.430
So if he experiences any
of the sounds Benelli did,

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.500
it could spell disaster for the Yorkie.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:51.853
Right away he's reluctant,

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.073
and a treat from trainer
Karyn works only for a moment.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.010
When she kneels down
to his level, however,

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.823
Mr. Pip discovers some courage.

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.333
Mr. Pip, this is not what
a good heel looks like.

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.663
Because it shows confidence,

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.280
something Mr. Pip has
struggled with in the past,

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.430
the trainer lets him pull ahead sometimes.

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.823
Unlike his bigger classmates,

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:19.290
Mr. Pip poses no threat
of pulling his future

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.023
owners into a dangerous situation.

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.583
So go ahead and tug.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:26.223
Way to make your size
work for you, Mr. Pip.

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:34.483
Now, it's our favorite wild
card's trip by the buses, Remmy.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.450
To everyone's surprise,
the eight month old

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:42.683
golden is doing well.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.550
That is, until (bus hisses).

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.980
The noise frightens not just Remmy,

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.623
but trainer Karyn as well.

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:54.753
At first, it looks like a
similar situation to Benelli.

00:11:55.664 --> 00:11:58.563
Remmy's tail is tucked and
she looks around nervously.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.580
Unlike Benelli, however, Remmy continues

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.780
to sniff around and
engage with her trainer,

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:06.163
even next to the tire.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:10.957
When the bus makes the noise again,

00:12:10.957 --> 00:12:12.413
Remmy responds better,

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.470
and she continues to sniff curiously.

00:12:15.654 --> 00:12:18.183
Still, her tail remains tucked,

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:19.880
even when the bus pulls away.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:23.323
As she approaches a turned off second bus,

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:25.700
the memory of the earlier
noise has her scared.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:29.280
Remmy will have to overcome this newfound

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.593
fear of tires to stay
in service dog school,

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:34.690
so Karyn drops treats to
build the golden's bravery.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:40.060
Even though she's still nervous,

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.233
Remmy's bounced back wonderfully.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.823
Unlike Benelli, she's stayed
by the buses the whole time;

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.690
a great sign for the young pup.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.723
Finally, it's Kaya's turn.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:57.263
Sandy, the owner of Doggie Do Good,

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.493
already has a family in mind for Kaya.

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:02.290
This particular placement means Kaya

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.313
would be around lots of loud noises.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.200
That makes today's trip crucial for

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.550
the eight month old golden.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.930
If she reacts to the loud noises

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:12.860
like Benelli or Remmy, it could mean

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:14.403
months added to her training.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.920
Months that that family would
have to make do without her.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.233
Right away, it looks
like Kaya's doing great.

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:24.943
Her tail is up and when the bus hisses,

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:26.300
she merely turns her head.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:30.750
As the bus pulls away,

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.010
Paul congratulates her
on her calm demeanor.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:36.750
Kaya knows she did a good job,

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.800
and she begins to prance with excitement.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.283
She's gonna make some family so happy,

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.610
and I'm gonna miss her.

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:53.423
It's the end of a long,
loud day at the bus station.

00:13:54.323 --> 00:13:56.953
But there's still one
more exercise in store.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.220
Very slowly, trainer Paul brings

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:02.293
Benelli back to a powered down bus.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.203
With no risk of sudden noise,

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:07.350
this is the safest time
for the chocolate lab

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:08.883
to begin overcoming her fear.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.770
Paul gets down on her level and gives her

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:14.213
lots of pets, helping
the puppy to feel safe.

00:14:15.920 --> 00:14:18.893
Eventually, Benelli walks past
the bus with relative ease.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:22.220
It's going to be a long
road to bus bravery

00:14:22.220 --> 00:14:23.277
for the chocolate lab,

00:14:23.277 --> 00:14:25.620
but with her tail wagging
this close to a tire,

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.120
she's made a great first step.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.330
The trainers knew the bus station would be

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.010
a challenging day, but they're proud of

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:36.710
the progress from all of the dogs.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.473
For most of these pups,

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.480
there are still months of lessons ahead.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.890
For Demian, however, there are only

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:44.683
two weeks until final exams.

00:14:45.369 --> 00:14:47.170
Will he become a cautionary tale

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.450
for his younger
classmates, or does he have

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.883
what it takes to graduate Puppy Prep?

00:14:53.043 --> 00:14:55.626
(upbeat music)

